cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mgnifam, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: mgnifam
abstract: >-
  Iterative HMM-based protein family generation over very large sequence databases.
  Builds protein families from sequence clusters by iterative HMM search, and
  refreshes existing family models against newer sequence databases.
authors:
